s_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_task14", "label": "Calibrate plan Task 14: Discovery -- the knee", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md"}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_task15", "label": "Calibrate plan Task 15: The baseline -- constant and stress at pool 5", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md"}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_task16", "label": "Calibrate plan Task 16: README, spec and plan amendments", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md"}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_task17", "label": "Calibrate plan Task 17: Tear down, or hand over to plan 4", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md"}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_task18", "label": "Calibrate plan Task 18: Make the calibrator runnable inside the image", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md"}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_task19", "label": "Calibrate plan Task 19: The measurement-free half of Task 11", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md"}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_task20", "label": "Calibrate plan Task 20: The README as a runbook", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md"}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_d1", "label": "Decision D1: heavy route gets timed wait beside its scan", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "rationale": "A pure CPU-only knob makes database load land at ~2.5x its vCPUs at the pool knee (5 x f / 2 with f~1), saturating pool and database together; splitting the hold into scan CPU cost and pg_sleep wait makes f a solvable variable."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_d2", "label": "Decision D2: calibration targets mean hold across the mix", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "rationale": "Plan 1's calibrator aimed the 20ms target at the heavy statement alone, but a report is only 5% of the mix, leaving the true mean hold at a few ms and the knee far above the 100-VU cap -- a plain arithmetic error."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_d3", "label": "Decision D3: class thresholds = 3x unloaded server-side p99", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "rationale": "3x leaves room so jitter and heartbeat traffic never breach at low load, while pool queueing (which grows steeply near saturation) still crosses it close to the knee."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_d4", "label": "Decision D4: seeding and calibration run inside the VPC", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "rationale": "Hold time measured from a laptop over the public endpoint would carry tens of ms of internet round-trip against a 20ms target, so both run as one-off Fargate tasks where the service runs."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_d5", "label": "Decision D5: the posts table is not reset; its size is recorded", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "rationale": "Kept from plan 2's ruling R20 because two files (slo.yaml, calibrate.js) still said the opposite ('re-seed before every run')."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_21_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_infrastructure", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_19_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_21_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_infrastructure_r17", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_d3", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 0.9, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "weight": 0.8}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_d5", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_21_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_infrastructure_r20", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-24-ecs-rds-postgres-pool-calibrate-baseline.md", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_24_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_calibrate_baseline_task2", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_21_ecs_rds_postgres_pool_infrastructure_task